// Registers the +hd= dump of tb_core.sv tracks (name, hierarchical expression, width).
// Every flop of the BMUL datapath (mlkem_poly_alu.sv, both mlkem_modmul instances) and the
// polynomial RAM output registers; scripts/sim/register_leakage.py ranks them.
// m0_r / m1_r are the u_mul0 / u_mul1 output flops (mul0.r / mul1.r): listed once.
// `R is defined by the includer.
